imilar paths just like  killmonger shuri has lost her last  remaining family member to an  unbelievably powerful ruler of a nation  that has access to vibranium and just  like killmonger shuri is completely  consumed with a request for Revenge  outwardly she rejects killmonger and  refuses to reveal their meeting to  anyone However the fact that she chooses  the killmonger style black panther  helmet almost immediately afterwards  implies that at least on some level she  realizes that her late cousin is correct  when she's discussing her anti-namor  plot which imbari libaku she seems to be  in full killmonger mode planning to take  the fight to the telecon king's Turf and  destroy him personally as you might  notice this is very similar to  killmonger's own approach against  wakanda and t'challa and black panther  I'm gonna check down anyone who would  even think about being loyal to you and  I'm gonna put their ass in the dirt  right next to Zuri fortunately for her  own mental well-being and the lives of  her allies shury's killmonger mode  doesn't last she shakes off the shackles  of her bloodlust after overpowering  Neymar in the desert and seeing a last  moment vision of her mother regaining  her kindness and rationality she accepts  Neymar's surrender and begins her path  towards spiritual healing just like  ramonda wanted to because of this the  movie ends with shuri in a much better  place it's extremely unlikely that  she'll continue to wear killmonger's  colors now that she seems to be truly  embracing her new role as wakanda's  protector as well as her even newer role  as the surprise Aunt to t'challa's son  to song combine this with shuri's habit  of redesigning and tinkering and it's  virtually guaranteed that she'll have  made a cool new black panther costume  the next time we see her if not several  after all a whole bunch of snazzy New  Black Panther costumes wouldn't exactly  hurt Disney's toy sales  movement
 

